Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Add unified InputManager autoload and MainMenu keyboard
 navigation

- Create Scripts/InputManager.gd combining all signals from InputHandler,
  EditorInputHandler, and SelectSong/InputManager into a single Autoload
- Add menu_select_up, menu_select_down, menu_confirm signals for MainMenu
- Register InputManager as Autoload in project.godot
- MainMenuButton: remove disabled manipulation from activate/deactivate
- MainMenuManager: activate index 0 on ready, up/down arrows cycle selection,
  Enter emits pressed on the selected button
- RhythmManager, SelectManager, EditorManager: switch from local input nodes
  to InputManager autoload

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_011uBepdouMRHABrZz6pfU68
